4. Trace-anomaly / quantum-curvature terms (ρ ~ N·H⁴)
   shear door (M2)   : N·H⁴ ≈ 1.29e-81 eV⁴ vs needed 6.15e+13 eV⁴  →  short 4.8e+94
   condensate floor  : N·H⁴ ≈ 5.01e-85 eV⁴ vs needed 1.26e+12 eV⁴  →  short 2.5e+96
   The metric-on curvature never comes within ~95 orders of the
